<StaticPage path="/ad-disclosure/" h1="Ad disclosure" updated="2026-11-23">
  <p class="mt-6">
    We pay for hosting and development with ads. Ads are always below the calculator. You can use every calculator without clicking any ad. Ad placement is
    never influenced by the calculation.
  </p>

  <h2>What that means in practice</h2>
  <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
    <li>
      <strong>The site is funded by advertising.</strong> It is the only way the site earns money. There is no subscription and no paid tier.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>One ad per page,</strong> clearly labelled "Advertisement", below the calculator and its result.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Every calculator is free and complete</strong> without any interaction with an ad. Nothing is locked, gated or slowed down until you click.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>The ad never affects the answer.</strong> The result depends only on the numbers you type and the formula shown on the page. The ad cannot see
      what you type.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>No paid recommendations.</strong> We do not take money to feature a lender, broker, clinic or product in a calculator or in its text.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>More detail</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/how-we-make-money/">How we make money</a> explains the model. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> lists the cookies advertising can set and
    how to turn off personalised ads.
  </p>
</StaticPage>
